          "description": "Nighttime Nathan is an imaginative adventure podcast with original songs for kids ages 3–10.\r\n\r\nPerfect for car rides, quiet time, weekends at home, or anytime kids want a great story.\r\n\r\n⭐ Follow the show so new adventures appear automatically each week.\r\n\r\n—\r\n\r\nAnytime’s a good time for Nighttime. \r\n\r\nJoin Nathan and Peanut Butter Jim as they zoom across the nighttime universe—meeting silly creatures, helping friends in need, and singing original songs along the way.\r\n\r\nEvery episode brings a brand-new world, a lovable friend, and a gentle lesson wrapped in imagination and adventure.\r\n\r\nPerfect for families looking for fun, screen-free entertainment wherever the day takes them.\r\n\r\nAges 3–10 • Stories For Kids • Music • Imagination",
